OL,3,GNEWSAPubs want help from government and
OL,4,Acustomers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPubs are calling for more government
OL,7,Fsupport and for customers to use them
OL,8,Fmore over the Christmas and New Year
OL,9,Fperiod, as many struggle to stay
OL,10,Fafloat.
OL,12,FAmong measures being asked for is a
OL,13,Flower rate of VAT for pubs as they
OL,14,Fbattle with high energy costs.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
