OL,3,GNEWSAPubs want help from government and
OL,4,Acustomers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne village pub landlord in Probus,
OL,7,FCornwall said: "The government like to
OL,8,Fthink they're listening to us and have
OL,9,Fintroduced things like business rate
OL,10,Frelief but that doesn't even scratch
OL,11,Fthe surface." Another in Camborne said
OL,12,Fit would have to "close the doors for
OL,13,Fgood" without more support from local
OL,14,Fpeople.
OL,16,FThe government said it was "on the side
OL,17,Fof businesses" and had taken a number
OL,18,Fof measures to allow more "breathing
OL,19,Fspace".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
